                "meaning": "how many; a few",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "a8a9f98af3d39e9d643e2f1f681f46033805efa1a4757de152d11416f16fc7a5"
              },
              {
                "text": "好多",
                "pinyin": "hǎoduō",
                "meaning": "many; a lot",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "25b7a403a57b6f91c135fd43c6e0839987a75ffb17072f8f5dfe04f232d1dd56"
              }
            ]
